  "question": {
    "text": "An organ pipe <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> long is open at both ends. The speed of sound in air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The frequency of the second harmonic is _<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "900",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula for the frequency in an open organ pipe is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Since, it is a second harmonic,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>The frequency of the second harmonic becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>The data given is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Substituting the values in the frequency formula</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
